; [expedition phase II] The Rune Floor's BattleWorld. The node names below are
; the ones battle_world.gd and BattleDirector reach for; the camera is placed by
; rune_floor_world.gd. Surround builds the void around the stage (per biome),
; Track the encounter islands the party crosses between, RuneFloor the board.
; The background is a void, not a sky: the island is the lit thing, the Lantern
; spec's "lit object held in real darkness".

